{"seq":1,"slug":"api-documentation","title":"API 文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance/api-documentation","wordCount":667,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"api-文档\">API 文档</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>API 文档是 API 产品的&quot;用户界面&quot;——开发者通过文档理解 API 的能力、使用方式和限制。好的 API 文档不仅是技术参考手册，更是开发者的<strong>入职引导</strong>和<strong>问题解决工具</strong>。研究表明，开发者选择 API 时，文档质量的权重甚至超过功能本身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[API 文档体系] --&gt; B[参考文档]&#10;    A --&gt; C[教程与指南]&#10;    A --&gt; D[交互式沙箱]&#10;    A --&gt; E[变更日志]&#10;    B --&gt; F[端点列表]&#10;    B --&gt; G[请求/响应模型]&#10;    B --&gt; H[错误码表]&#10;    C --&gt; I[快速开始]&#10;    C --&gt; J[使用场景]&#10;    D --&gt; K[API 试用]&#10;    D --&gt; L[代码示例]\">graph TD\n    A[API 文档体系] --&gt; B[参考文档]\n    A --&gt; C[教程与指南]\n    A --&gt; D[交互式沙箱]\n    A --&gt; E[变更日志]\n    B --&gt; F[端点列表]\n    B --&gt; G[请求/响应模型]\n    B --&gt; H[错误码表]\n    C --&gt; I[快速开始]\n    C --&gt; J[使用场景]\n    D --&gt; K[API 试用]\n    D --&gt; L[代码示例]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档类型</th>\n<th>目标读者</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>维护方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参考文档</td>\n<td>所有开发者</td>\n<td>端点、参数、响应</td>\n<td>从代码自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速开始</td>\n<td>新用户</td>\n<td>5分钟完成首次调用</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用指南</td>\n<td>中级用户</td>\n<td>常见场景实现</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更日志</td>\n<td>现有用户</td>\n<td>版本差异、迁移方法</td>\n<td>自动 + 手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误参考</td>\n<td>调试中的开发者</td>\n<td>错误码、解决方案</td>\n<td>手动维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"openapi-规范\">OpenAPI 规范</h2><p>OpenAPI（原 Swagger）是 REST API 描述的事实标准。它用 YAML/JSON 格式描述 API 的全部细节，工具链可以从中生成文档、客户端 SDK 和服务器存根。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"openapi: 3.1.0&#10;info:&#10;  title: User Service API&#10;  version: 2.0.0&#10;  description: 用户管理服务 API&#10;  contact:&#10;    name: Platform Team&#10;    email: platform@example.com&#10;&#10;servers:&#10;  - url: https://api.example.com/v2&#10;    description: Production&#10;  - url: https://api-staging.example.com/v2&#10;    description: Staging&#10;&#10;paths:&#10;  /users:&#10;    get:&#10;      operationId: listUsers&#10;      summary: 获取用户列表&#10;      tags: [Users]&#10;      parameters:&#10;        - name: page&#10;          in: query&#10;          schema:&#10;            type: integer&#10;            default: 1&#10;            minimum: 1&#10;        - name: per_page&#10;          in: query&#10;          schema:&#10;            type: integer&#10;            default: 20&#10;            minimum: 1&#10;            maximum: 100&#10;        - name: role&#10;          in: query&#10;          schema:&#10;            $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/UserRole&#39;&#10;      responses:&#10;        &#39;200&#39;:&#10;          description: 用户列表&#10;          content:&#10;            application/json:&#10;              schema:&#10;                $ref: &#39;#/components/schemas/UserListResponse&#39;&#10;        &#39;401&#39;:&#10;          $ref: &#39;#/components/responses/Unauthorized&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">openapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">User Service API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">用户管理服务 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Platform Team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">platform@example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">servers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api.example.com/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://api-staging.example.com/v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  /users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      operationId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">listUsers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">获取用户列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      parameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#0