式文档\">交互式文档</h2><p>静态文档不够——开发者需要<strong>试用</strong> API。交互式文档让开发者在浏览器中直接发送请求，看到实际响应。</p>\n<p>主流工具对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>OpenAPI 支持</th>\n<th>自定义程度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Swagger UI</td>\n<td>嵌入式</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>内部 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redoc</td>\n<td>静态生成</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>公开文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stoplight</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>企业 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scalar</td>\n<td>嵌入式</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>现代 UI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { swaggerUI } from &#39;@hono/swagger-ui&#39;;&#10;import { apiReference } from &#39;@scalar/hono-api-reference&#39;;&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/docs/swagger&#39;, swaggerUI({ url: &#39;/openapi.json&#39; }));&#10;&#10;app.get(&#10;  &#39;/docs&#39;,&#10;  apiReference({&#10;    spec: { url: &#39;/openapi.json&#39; },&#10;    theme: &#39;purple&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/openapi.json&#39;, (c) =&gt; c.json(spec));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { swaggerUI } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@hono/swagger-ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { apiReference } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@scalar/hono-api-reference'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1