"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/openapi.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spec));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"代码示例与-sdk\">代码示例与 SDK</h2><p>好的 API 文档包含<strong>每个端点的代码示例</strong>，至少覆盖 cURL 和主流语言。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CodeExample {&#10;  language: string;&#10;  label: string;&#10;  code: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const listUsersExamples: CodeExample[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    language: &#39;bash&#39;,&#10;    label: &#39;cURL&#39;,&#10;    code: `curl -X GET &quot;https://api.example.com/v2/users?page=1&amp;per_page=20&quot; \\\\&#10;  -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN&quot; \\\\&#10;  -H &quot;Accept: application/json&quot;`,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    language: &#39;typescript&#39;,&#10;    label: &#39;TypeScript&#39;,&#10;    code: `const response = await fetch(&#39;https://api.example.com/v2/users?page=1&#39;, {&#10;  headers: { Authorization: \\`Bearer \\${token}\\` },&#10;})&#10;const { data, meta } = await response.json()`,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeExample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> listUsersExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeExample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    language: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cURL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    code: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`curl -X GET \"https://api.example.com/v2/users?page=1&#x26;per_page=20\" </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  -H \"Accept: application/json\"`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    language: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    code: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`const response = await fetch('https://api.example.com/v2/users?page=1', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  headers: { Authorization: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Bearer </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{token}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">const { data, meta } = await response.json()`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动生成客户端 SDK 是更进一步的做法。OpenAPI Generator 可以从 OpenAPI 规范生成多种语言的类型安全客户端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>API 文档是 API 产品的用户界面——文档质量直接影响开发者采用率</li>\n<li>OpenAPI 是 REST API 描述的事实标准，工具链可生成文档、SDK 和测试</li>\n<li>从代码生成文档（Zod → OpenAPI）是保持文档与代码同步的最佳方式</li>\n<li>交互式文档（Swagger UI、Scalar）让开发者直接试用 API，降低入门门槛</li>\n<li>代码示例至少覆盖 cURL 和主流语言，类型安全的 SDK 是最佳开发者体验</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"API 文档","id":"api-文档"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAPI 规范","id":"openapi-规范"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 定义与代码同步","id":"schema-定义与代码同步"},{"level":2,"text":"交互式文档","id":"交互式文档"},{"level":2,"text":"代码示例与 SDK","id":"代码示例与-sdk"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流式通信模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/grpc-and-rpc/streaming-patterns"},"next":{"title":"API 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/api-governance/api-testing"}}